01D2                          DS   FAST,ANXT/256   
01D2                             ; "\" ( flag -- ): true skips to the next ")" or "]" at this level; ")"
01D2                             ; drops the block start, "]" returns. No closer at all ends the program.
01D2                             ; The flag stays in HL as the spent cell that rdrop and ret2 drop.
01D2   7C           H_BREAK:   MOV   A,H   
01D3   B5                     ORA   L   
01D4   CA A6 02               JZ   h_drop   ; false: just drop the flag
01D7   CD 70 04               CALL   skip   
01DA   B7                     ORA   A   ; skip returns 0 for ")"
01DB   C2 CA 01               JNZ   ret2   
01DE   C3 06 01               JMP   rdrop   
01E1                             ; "[" followed by a letter stores the body"s address in that letter"s cell:
01E1                             ; uppercase is a word, lowercase a variable. Followed by a space it pushes
01E1                             ; the body"s address instead. Either way it then skips to the matching "]'.
01E1                             ; (The unchecked build takes anything that is not a letter as the space; the
01E1                             ; checked build stops on it.)
