020A                             ;  Handlers that must start in the image's second page.
020A                             ;  "?" is the last (with "," inside it in the unchecked build), so its long
020A                             ;  tail may run past that page.
020A                             ; =============================================================================
020A                             ; ---- flow control ----------------------------------------------------------
020A                             ; "(" ( flag -- ): true pushes the block start and enters; false skips to
020A                             ; the matching ")".
